@testapp_HostAddress = http://localhost:5091

### Index
GET {{testapp_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### health / telemetry-backend connectivity (no tracing/logs/metrics emitted)
GET {{testapp_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### --- Traces ---

### simple span
GET {{testapp_HostAddress}}/traces/simple
Accept: application/json

### span with explicit OK status
GET {{testapp_HostAddress}}/traces/ok
Accept: application/json

### two traces with a span link from the second to the first
GET {{testapp_HostAddress}}/traces/linked
Accept: application/json

### nested spans (depth 1-10)
GET {{testapp_HostAddress}}/traces/nested?depth=4
Accept: application/json

### parallel sibling spans (count 1-20)
GET {{testapp_HostAddress}}/traces/parallel?count=5
Accept: application/json

### slow span (ms 0-30000)
GET {{testapp_HostAddress}}/traces/slow?ms=500
Accept: application/json

### erroring span (type: invalid|timeout|argument|notfound)
GET {{testapp_HostAddress}}/traces/error?type=invalid
Accept: application/json

### distributed (hops 0-5; each hop produces a client+server span pair)
GET {{testapp_HostAddress}}/traces/distributed?hops=2
Accept: application/json

### span with diverse attribute types and events
GET {{testapp_HostAddress}}/traces/attributes
Accept: application/json

### --- Logs ---

### one log per severity level
GET {{testapp_HostAddress}}/logs/levels
Accept: application/json

### structured logs with parameters
GET {{testapp_HostAddress}}/logs/structured?count=5&user=alice
Accept: application/json

### error log carrying an exception
GET {{testapp_HostAddress}}/logs/exception
Accept: application/json

### scoped logs (BeginScope)
GET {{testapp_HostAddress}}/logs/scoped
Accept: application/json

### log correlated to an active trace
GET {{testapp_HostAddress}}/logs/correlated
Accept: application/json

### --- Metrics ---

### counter increment
POST {{testapp_HostAddress}}/metrics/counter?inc=3&label=api
Accept: application/json

### up-down counter
POST {{testapp_HostAddress}}/metrics/updown?delta=1
Accept: application/json

### histogram observation
POST {{testapp_HostAddress}}/metrics/histogram?value=42.7&op=read
Accept: application/json

### observable gauge value
POST {{testapp_HostAddress}}/metrics/gauge?value=12
Accept: application/json

### --- Composite scenarios ---

### successful user transaction (trace + logs + metrics)
GET {{testapp_HostAddress}}/scenarios/user-transaction
Accept: application/json

### error cascade (correlated trace + error log + counter)
GET {{testapp_HostAddress}}/scenarios/error-cascade
Accept: application/json

### --- Telemetry control ---

### force-flush all OTLP exporters (use before querying the backend in E2E tests)
POST {{testapp_HostAddress}}/telemetry/flush
Accept: application/json

### force-flush with a custom timeout
POST {{testapp_HostAddress}}/telemetry/flush?timeoutMs=10000
Accept: application/json

### --- Lifecycle ---

### graceful shutdown (202 Accepted, then host tears down and flushes OTLP)
POST {{testapp_HostAddress}}/shutdown
Accept: application/json

###
